      "ws": "% FOPDT process: G(s) = K e^(-L s) / (T s + 1)\nK = 1;\nT = 5;\nL = 1;\n% Ziegler-Nichols open-loop (reaction curve) tuning\nKp_P   = T/(K*L);\nKp_PID = 1.2*T/(K*L);\nKi_PID = Kp_PID/(2*L);\nKd_PID = Kp_PID*0.5*L;\n% SIMC PI tuning with tau_c = L\nKp_PI = T/(K*2*L);\nKi_PI = Kp_PI/min(T, 8*L);\n% load disturbance at the process input\nd = 0.5;\ntd = 30;",
      "name": "pid_fopdt_tuning_comparison"
    }
